  "notes": "ふける is an intransitive verb meaning to be absorbed or lost in something.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: Intransitive ({自動詞|じどうし})\n- Pattern: Xにふける (to be absorbed in X)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {空想|くうそう}にふける: to be lost in fantasy/daydreaming\n- {物思|ものおも}いにふける: to be lost in thought\n- {感傷|かんしょう}にふける: to indulge in sentimentality\n- {酒|さけ}にふける: to indulge in drinking\n\nASPECT (ている):\n- ふけっている: state of being absorbed in",
